# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw source data -- deliberately NOT tracked
#
# dataset/raw/ is 95 MB of real public source JSON (schedules.json alone is
# 82 MB). It is read-only input: no script in this project ever writes to it,
# so it carries none of the accidental-overwrite risk this repository exists
# to guard against. Committing it would permanently bloat history and push
# schedules.json past GitHub's 50 MB warning threshold.
#
# Integrity is still verifiable: the SHA-256 prefixes of all three files are
# recorded in dataset/metadata/manifest.json (source_hashes), which IS
# tracked, and the files are re-downloadable from
# https://github.com/datameet/railways (CC0).
#
# Remove these two lines if you decide a fully self-contained offline archive
# matters more than repository size.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Dataset/blockplan-dataset/dataset/raw/
